{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:01.48] Bitch, I'm in Greece like Zeus\n[00:02.80] Uh-huh (Ayy, KBeaZy, you fired up), yeah\n[00:05.24] Raf Simons on my shoe, ooh\n[00:06.90] Margiela on my shoe, uh\n[00:08.72] Murakami on my shoe\n[00:10.36] One-of-one, these are not for you\n[00:12.12] Too high, can't talk to you (Let's go, let's go)\n[00:14.46] To all my ex's that wanna be friends\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:16.54] Boo-thing lame, 'cause I'm not them\n[00:18.26] You see me walkin' around in your rent\n[00:19.78] In this Burberry poncho, it look like a tent\n[00:21.72] Audemar on my wrist, I'ma ball on a bitch\n[00:23.40] Spend it all on my bitch's (Cake)\n[00:25.20] Nah, I'm lyin', I ain't spend it all 'cause I'm rich\n[00:27.06] I be handlin' my business (Hooray)\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:29.00] In the studio all night long\n[00:30.50] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[00:32.66] Oh, yeah, hold me closе, you got that good\n[00:35.54] You make me feel rich evеn if I was broke, that's all on the hood\n[00:39.10] And you understand me I ain't have to show you the ropes, I'm so misunderstood\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[00:44.20] Ayy, I love daily trips to the bank\n[00:46.80] I sit in the passenger seat while you drive, you hate when I drive and I drink\n[00:50.28] Cut one of my day one niggas off, so I wanna listen to Drake\n[00:53.92] Talkin' 'bout that Thank Me Later, how the fame'll make 'em change\n[00:57.52] I'm done doin' niggas favors\n[00:59.28] I'm just focused on collectin' paper and lovin' my baby and startin' a label\n[01:02.96] Gotta watch who you let grab a seat and a plate\n[01:04.74] They can't eat, ain't no fakes at the table\n[01:06.60] Gotta cut 'em off, give 'em the razor\n[01:08.46] It's a shock when they switch on you, taser\n[01:10.16] I wear that pain like a mask, Darth Vader\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[01:12.52] In the studio all night long\n[01:14.04] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[01:16.36] Oh, yeah, hold me close, you got that good\n[01:19.18] You make me feel rich even if I was broke, that's all on the hood\n[01:22.74] And you understand me I ain't have to show you the ropes, I'm so misunderstood\n[01:25.76] In the studio all night long\n[01:28.70] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[01:30.88] Oh, yeah, hold me close, you got that good\n[01:33.70] You make me feel rich even if I was broke, that's all on the hood\n[01:37.06] And you understand me I ain't have to show you the ropes, I'm so misunderstood\n[Verse 3: Seezyn & Juice WRLD]\n[01:43.26] Yuh\n[01:43.36] Yeah, that money just hit my account that I made from the back end (Yeah)\n[01:46.88] Turn that little bitch frown upside down when she sees them racks in my hand (Let's Go)\n[01:50.60] In a new era, only time that we cappin' (Yeah)\n[01:54.14] Quentin Tarantino with the pistol man, this shit can get tragic\n[01:56.74] Ooh-nah-nah when I went home (Yeah)\n[01:58.64] Clip was long, if I shoot this shit then you know you're gone (Yeah)\n[02:02.32] Bad bitch all on my dick, she gon' watch her tone (Yeah)\n[02:06.02] If that hoe get out of line, I'm gon' send her home (Yeah)\n[02:10.52] Yeah, face it, yeah a lot of us gon' face it\n[02:14.18] Yes, I'm making lots of hits, yeah\n[02:16.00] Home runs gon' basic\n[02:17.22] Tell that little bitch to take care, I was on my Drake shit (Yeah)\n[02:21.46] Yeah, we got a lot of drip in here if you need hydration\n[02:24.76] Nah bitch, don't put the drugs in here, gotta take it to the vacant\n[02:28.28] Bitch, I’m the plug, I’m right here\n[02:30.50] Told the doctor I'm a patient, yeah\n[02:32.62] 999 'til I D-I-E\n[02:33.14] Fuck niggas get hit with a DDT\n[02:34.26] I feel like Adele, I’m rolling in deep\n[02:35.74] Seezyn giving them hell, like controlling the street\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD, Seezyn, Both]\n[02:39.04] In the studio all night long (In the studio all night long)\n[02:40.66] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home (Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home)\n[02:43.56] Oh, yeah, hold me close, you got that good\n[02:46.42] You make me feel rich even if I was broke (Even if I was broke), that's on the hood\n[02:49.86] And you understand me I ain't have to show you the ropes, I'm so misunderstood (Oh)\n[02:53.02] In the studio all night long (Yeah)\n[02:56.12] Want the ooh-nah-nah when I get home\n[02:58.90] Oh, yeah, hold me close, you got that good\n[03:00.96] You make me feel rich even if I was broke, that's all on the hood\n[03:04.52] And you understand me I ain't have to show you the ropes, I'm so misunderstood\n[Outro: Seezyn]\n[03:30.20] 999 till I D-I-E\n[03:32.00] Fuck niggas get hit with a DDT\n[03:32.68] Don't leave, Jake","words":[[0.2,0.38,"[Intro:"],[0.48,0.98,"Juice"],[1.06,1.22,"WRLD]"],[1.48,1.6,"Bitch,"],[1.64,1.68,"I'm"],[1.74,1.82,"in"],[1.9,2.18,"Greece"],[2.22,2.34,"like"],[2.38,2.62,"Zeus"],[2.8,3.28,"Uh-huh"],[3.32,3.86,"(Ayy,"],[3.92,4.28,"KBeaZy,"],[4.32,4.68,"you"],[4.9,5.0,"fired"],[5.06,5.08,"up),"],[5.12,5.2,"yeah"],[5.24,5.28,"Raf"],[5.32,5.54,"Simons"],[5.58,5.6,"on"],[5.7,5.82,"my"],[5.94,6.12,"shoe,"],[6.16,6.86,"ooh"],[6.9,7.26,"Margiela"],[7.3,7.4,"on"],[7.54,7.58,"my"],[7.76,7.92,"shoe,"],[7.96,8.0,"uh"],[8.72,9.14,"Murakami"],[9.2,9.28,"on"],[9.4,9.44,"my"],[9.62,9.76,"shoe"],[10.36,10.72,"One-of-one,"],[10.76,10.88,"these"],[10.92,10.98,"are"],[11.02,11.2,"not"],[11.3,11.38,"for"],[11.44,11.54,"you"],[12.12,12.28,"Too"],[12.34,12.52,"high,"],[12.56,12.76,"can't"],[12.8,13.04,"talk"],[13.14,13.18,"to"],[13.28,13.36,"you"],[13.46,13.58,"(Let's"],[13.74,13.8,"go,"],[13.94,14.06,"let's"],[14.16,14.22,"go)"],[14.46,14.52,"To"],[14.7,14.78,"all"],[14.86,15.0,"my"],[15.12,15.34,"ex's"],[15.38,15.48,"that"],[15.54,15.66,"wanna"],[15.7,15.72,"be"],[15.76,15.9,"friends"],[15.94,16.08,"[Verse"],[16.1,16.12,"1:"],[16.2,16.32,"Juice"],[16.44,16.5,"WRLD]"],[16.54,16.84,"Boo-thing"],[16.9,17.18,"lame,"],[17.24,17.4,"'cause"],[17.44,17.5,"I'm"],[17.56,17.7,"not"],[17.8,18.04,"them"],[18.26,18.32,"You"],[18.38,18.5,"see"],[18.56